{"id":"604953","name":"干豆角酱肉包","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/604953/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干豆角","amount":"250g"},{"name":"五花肉肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"(40度以下)少许"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干豆角一袋。","img":"images/604953/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"干豆角放入盆中。","img":"images/604953/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"干豆角用温水泡软后清洗干净。(干豆角浸泡的时间约2小时)","img":"images/604953/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切小丁。","img":"images/604953/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"五花肉放入盆中。","img":"images/604953/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加少许料酒、生抽、盐和香酱腌制一会儿。","img":"images/604953/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"葱和姜切碎。","img":"images/604953/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"豆角、葱和姜也放入盆中，如图所示。","img":"images/604953/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加适量盐、少许生抽、老抽、蚝油、香酱、五香粉和鸡精，用筷子搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/604953/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"面粉中加酵母和温水，搅拌成絮状，醒发两倍大，揉成光滑。","img":"images/604953/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搓成长条状，切成大小均匀的剂子。","img":"images/604953/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀成中间厚四周薄的包子皮。","img":"images/604953/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/604953/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"已包好。","img":"images/604953/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"冷水上笼。","img":"images/604953/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"大火烧开转中火蒸十五分钟，关火焖五分钟。","img":"images/604953/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"已蒸好。","img":"images/604953/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/604953/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"软软的。","img":"images/604953/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"掰开，滑嫩鲜香又松软。","img":"images/604953/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}